{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "latam", "appid": 553850, "month": "2026-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1771200000, "end_date": 1771891199, "month_true_total": 171, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:21:46 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "219070301", "author": {"steamid": "76561198808213889", "personaname": "Capitan Pancho", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198808213889/", "num_games_owned": 275, "num_reviews": 115, "playtime_forever": 1817, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 22, "playtime_at_review": 1817, "last_played": 1787627758, "avatar": "f943600c5fb037aecc6c315f246ef0f60b8cb05f"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Desde la ultima actualizacion el juego funciona demasiado mal...muchisimas bajas de fotogramas a comparacion de lo que era antes...nose que paso, antes podia jugarlo a muy buenos fps aunque sea en bajo y algunas cuestiones personalizadas", "timestamp_created": 1771880173, "timestamp_updated": 1787627801, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219028421", "author": {"steamid": "76561199812598816", "personaname": "Ostwind", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199812598816/", "num_games_owned": 239, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 8023, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2013, "last_played": 1784450986, "avatar": "1f3a117a283b59dcf0eb4707ff0b4dba78a7eb72"}, "language": "latam", "review": "SOY GRINDEODIVER Y AUN NO HE DESBLOQUEADO AL 100 UN SOLO MALDITO PASE.", "timestamp_created": 1771838746, "timestamp_updated": 1771838746, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219011737", "author": {"steamid": "76561198399443699", "personaname": "Mosti-Gra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198399443699/", "num_games_owned": 128, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 8886, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 210, "playtime_at_review": 3716, "last_played": 1787936815, "avatar": "e877bcfaddf9d00034a4608abf94ea8e1f86007e"}, "language": "latam", "review": "El juego es tan bueno, que no se me ocurre forma de describirlo, la unica forma es con una receta de como hacer una Rica y deliciosa Pastaflora:\r\nINGREDIENTES:\r\nMasa:\r\nManteca pomada 200 g\r\nAzúcar 180 g\r\nHuevos 2 unidades\r\nRalladura de limón ½ unidad\r\nEsencia de vainilla ½ cda\r\nSal ½ cda\r\nPolvo leudante 10 g\r\nHarina 0000 400 g \r\n\r\nRELLENO:\r\nDulce de membrillo 500 g\r\nAgua caliente 100 cc\r\nVino Oporto 50 cc \r\n\r\nInstrucciones:\r\nMasa: Batir la manteca pomada con el azúcar hasta obtener una crema. Añadir los huevos, esencia de vainilla y ralladura de limón. Tamizar la harina con sal y polvo leudante, hacer una corona y mezclar sin amasar. Frezar la masa 1–2 veces hasta homogeneizar. Formar un cuadrado, cubrir con film y refrigerar al menos 2 horas. \r\nRelleno: Cortar el dulce de membrillo en cubos, calentar con agua y vino a fuego suave hasta formar una pasta. Dejar enfriar. \r\nArmado: Estirar ¾ de la masa hasta 5 mm de espesor, forrar un molde de 26–28 cm. Rellenar con el dulce de membrillo. Estirar el resto de la masa y cortar tiras de 2 cm para hacer el enrejado. \r\nHorneado: Pincelar las tiras con huevo batido, colocar sobre el relleno formando un enrejado. Hornear a 180 °C durante 40–45 minutos hasta dorar.  Dejar enfriar antes de servir.\r\n\r\nVariantes y Consejos:\r\nHarina leudante: Si usas harina leudante, puede reducirse el polvo leudante (ej. 250 g harina leudante en lugar de 400 g harina + 10 g polvo). \r\nRelleno alternativo: Puedes usar dulce de leche, batata, dulce de frambuesa o dulce de damasco. \r\nSin horno: Si no tienes horno, puedes cocinarla en una plancha caliente con tapa (método tradicional).\r\nConservación: La masa se puede refrigerar hasta 3 días o congelar hasta 2 meses.\r\n\r\n\r\nFOOOR SUPEREEEEARTH!", "timestamp_created": 1771815683, "timestamp_updated": 1771815683, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219004993", "author": {"steamid": "76561198380146814", "personaname": "Angelyowtf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198380146814/", "num_games_owned": 38, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 7923, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 158, "playtime_at_review": 5467, "last_played": 1787793998, "avatar": "b99452382f4ef1f961205e63e34441d9c3924b60"}, "language": "latam", "review": "ta bueno", "timestamp_created": 1771807882, "timestamp_updated": 1771807882, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218997827", "author": {"steamid": "76561198436406999", "personaname": "SoulEAter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198436406999/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 18909, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1493, "playtime_at_review": 8467, "last_played": 1787788030, "avatar": "718b26